{"name":"Skeleton","size":"medium","type":"undead","tag":"","alignment":"lawful evil","hitDice":"2","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":1,"otherArmorDesc":"10 (armor scraps)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"13 (2d8 + 4)","speedDesc":"9m","strPoints":"10","dexPoints":"16","conPoints":"15","intPoints":"6","wisPoints":"8","chaPoints":"5","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1/4","customCr":"1/4 (50 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The skeleton can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The skeleton regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the skeleton can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the skeleton can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The skeleton can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the skeleton's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the skeleton's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the skeleton dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[],"actions":[{"name":"Shortsword","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [DEX ATK] to hit, reach 1m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D6] piercing damage."},{"name":"Shortbow","desc":"_Ranged Weapon Attack:_ [DEX ATK] to hit, range 24/97m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D6] piercing damage."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[{"name":"Bludgeoning (x2)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"conditions":[{"name":"exhaustion"},{"name":"poisoned"}],"languages":[{"name":"the languages it knew in life","speaks":false}],"understandsBut":"can't speak","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}